WEBVTT

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/1-0
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<v Analyst>Maria, please walk us through how you enter an order.</v>

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/2-0
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Maria Keller>Every order arrives by email. First I find the customer in Order Desk.</v>

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/3-0
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
<v Maria Keller>Then I choose the product, type the quantity and the delivery date, and save the order.</v>

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/4-0
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:35.000
<v Maria Keller>After saving, I copy the order line into our tracking sheet in Excel, by hand.</v>

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/5-0
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
<v Maria Keller>Then New order, and Order Desk is ready for the next one.</v>

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/6-0
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.000
<v Maria Keller>Northwind I find by their customer number.</v>

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/7-0
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:59.000
<v Maria Keller>Northwind wants a printed confirmation with every order, so I print it.</v>

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/8-0
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.000
<v Maria Keller>The office chair is new in the sheet, so I look up its SAP material in the mapping file.</v>

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/9-0
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:23.000
<v Maria Keller>Brightline is a new customer, so I create them first.</v>

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/10-0
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:51.000
<v Maria Keller>I check the total in Calculator before I type it into the sheet.</v>

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/11-0
00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:56.000
<v Analyst>Is that check part of the process?</v>

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/12-0
00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:00.000
<v Maria Keller>No, it is just my habit.</v>

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/13-0
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:16.000
<v Maria Keller>That is the wrong customer, I cancel and search again.</v>

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/14-0
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:37.000
<v Maria Keller>And the Fabrikam line goes into the sheet as well.</v>

d3m0a1b2-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/15-0
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:43.000
<v Analyst>Thank you, that is all four orders.</v>
